{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioStatements",
  "$description": "The statement editor (spec §20): a Function entry's `body: JxStatement[]` edited as STRUCTURE rather than as text. The rows arrive FLAT. A statement tree nests to any depth — an `if` holds two lanes, a `$switch` holds one per case plus a default, and either may hold another of both — while a document's one repeater is `$prototype: \"Array\"` over a list, so `panels/statement-editor.ts` walks the tree once and hands over rows that already carry their own indent; recursion is a property of the walk, exactly as it is for the Data panel's value tree. Four kinds of row come out of that walk: a statement CARD (its header, and the fields that statement is made of), a LANE header naming a branch, the ADD control that ends every lane, and an ACTION that grows the statement itself (`+ Add else`, `+ Add case`). Two hosts draw this — the Navigator's State panel and the Inspector's Logic tab — and neither is named here: the region is stamped on the host, because a shared control cannot know where it is. An operand is an ISLAND: the document renders `[part=\"control-host\"]` and nothing inside it, and the flow fills it with the expression editor (studio-ui-guidelines.md §9.4).",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "statements"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "The whole of the editor's look, and the conversion moved three things rather than transcribing them. THE INDENT IS A VARIABLE: a lane's depth used to be a nested `<div class=\"statement-lane\">` per level, so a card six deep was six boxes; `--stmt-indent` is written inline per row and read by one shared rule, so a tree of any depth interns one declaration. THE DRAG FEEDBACK IS DATA, NOT CLASSES: `dragging`, `drop-above` and `drop-below` were class toggles with no rule anywhere in the package — they are `data-dragging` and `data-drop` now, and they finally draw. AND `min-width: 0` IS ON EVERY LINK OF THE CHAIN, which is the defect that sent this surface to a stylesheet in the first place: an inline `style=` attribute could not carry it, so at Inspector width an If/Else card pushed its operand controls past the right edge of the window.",
    "display": "flex",
    "flexDirection": "column",
    "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)",
    "minWidth": "0",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
    "color": "var(--fg)",
    "& [part=\"card\"]": {
      "$description": "One statement. A box rather than a bare row because a statement CONTAINS things — its operands, and the lanes under it — and the border is what says where it stops.",
      "boxSizing": "border-box",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "marginInlineStart": "var(--stmt-indent, 0)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--jx-border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-sm)",
      "background": "var(--jx-bg-input)"
    },
    "& [part=\"card\"][data-dragging]": {
      "opacity": "0.4"
    },
    "& [part=\"card\"][data-drop=\"above\"]": {
      "borderBlockStartColor": "var(--jx-accent)"
    },
    "& [part=\"card\"][data-drop=\"below\"]": {
      "borderBlockEndColor": "var(--jx-accent)"
    },
    "& [part=\"card-head\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"drag\"]": {
      "$description": "A plain span, not a button: the drag adapter needs an element native drag events pass straight through, and a control would swallow the pointer press that starts the drag. Keyboard reorder is the lane's own concern (WCAG 2.2 SC 2.5.7) and is not carried by this handle.",
      "flex": "0 0 auto",
      "display": "inline-flex",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "cursor": "grab"
    },
    "& [part=\"kind\"]": {
      "flex": "1 1 auto",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"card-body\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"field\"]": {
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"control-host\"]": {
      "$description": "Where the expression editor lands. Sized by the row rather than by what is dropped into it, so a formula that grows a row of chips does not widen the Inspector.",
      "display": "block",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"flags\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"lane\"]": {
      "$description": "A branch's name. The rule on the leading edge is the connector: it is what makes the cards under a `Then` read as being inside it rather than after it.",
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "marginInlineStart": "var(--stmt-indent, 0)",
      "paddingInlineStart": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "borderInlineStart": "2px solid var(--jx-border)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"lane-label\"]": {
      "flex": "1 1 auto",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"lane-key\"]": {
      "flex": "1 1 auto",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"add\"], & [part=\"action\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "marginInlineStart": "var(--stmt-indent, 0)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "$prototype": "Array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/state/rows"
      },
      "key": {
        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
      },
      "map": {
        "tagName": "div",
        "attributes": {
          "part": "row-slot",
          "role": "none"
        },
        "style": {
          "display": "contents"
        },
        "$switch": {
          "$ref": "$map/item/kind"
        },
        "cases": {
          "card": {
            "$description": "`data-stmt-row`, `data-stmt-lane` and `data-stmt-index` are the drag adapter's addressing, unchanged from the lit version: a card may only be dropped into the lane it came from, and the lane id is what says so.",
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "card",
              "data-stmt-row": "",
              "data-stmt-kind": "${$map.item.stmt}",
              "data-stmt-lane": "${$map.item.lane}",
              "data-stmt-index": "${$map.item.index}"
            },
            "style": {
              "--stmt-indent": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/indent"
              }
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "card-head"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tagName": "span",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "drag",
                      "title": "Drag to reorder",
                      "aria-hidden": "true"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "jx-icon",
                        "$props": {
                          "name": "dots-three-vertical"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "span",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "kind"
                    },
                    "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "delete"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "size": "sm",
                      "quiet": true,
                      "icon": "trash",
                      "label": "${$map.item.title}"
                    },
                    "onclick": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/remove"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "card-body"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "$prototype": "Array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/fields"
                    },
                    "key": {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                    },
                    "map": {
                      "$description": "One operand of the statement. Every field is `span` — the Inspector is 280px and the guidelines' standard row is vertically stacked (§4.1) — and every field carries `data-prop`, which is what `inspector/field:<prop>` addresses. The key is `<row>::<prop>`, self-contained because this `$map` shadows the row's own `$map.item`.",
                      "tagName": "jx-field",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "field",
                        "data-prop": "${$map.item.prop}"
                      },
                      "$props": {
                        "label": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/label"
                        },
                        "span": true
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "widget-slot",
                            "role": "none"
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "display": "contents"
                          },
                          "$switch": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/kind"
                          },
                          "cases": {
                            "control": {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "control-host",
                                "data-field": "${$map.item.key}"
                              }
                            },
                            "text": {
                              "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "text"
                              },
                              "$props": {
                                "size": "sm",
                                "label": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/label"
                                },
                                "value": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                                },
                                "placeholder": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/placeholder"
                                }
                              },
                              "oninput": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/setField"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            "select": {
                              "tagName": "jx-select",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "select"
                              },
                              "$props": {
                                "size": "sm",
                                "label": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/label"
                                },
                                "value": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                                },
                                "options": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/options"
                                }
                              },
                              "onchange": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/setField"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            "flags": {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "flags"
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "$prototype": "Array",
                                  "items": {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/flags"
                                  },
                                  "key": {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                  },
                                  "map": {
                                    "tagName": "jx-checkbox",
                                    "attributes": {
                                      "part": "flag",
                                      "data-flag": "${$map.item.key}"
                                    },
                                    "$props": {
                                      "size": "sm",
                                      "label": {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/label"
                                      },
                                      "checked": {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/checked"
                                      }
                                    },
                                    "onchange": {
                                      "$prototype": "Function",
                                      "body": [
                                        {
                                          "operator": "call",
                                          "target": {
                                            "$ref": "#/state/setFlag"
                                          },
                                          "value": [
                                            {
                                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "$ref": "event#/target/checked"
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "lane": {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "lane",
              "data-lane": "${$map.item.lane}"
            },
            "style": {
              "--stmt-indent": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/indent"
              }
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "lane-name-slot",
                  "role": "none"
                },
                "style": {
                  "display": "contents"
                },
                "$switch": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/editable"
                },
                "cases": {
                  "false": {
                    "tagName": "span",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "lane-label"
                    },
                    "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                  },
                  "true": {
                    "$description": "A `$switch` case's value is its own name, so the lane header of a case IS a text field. It commits on change rather than on input: renaming a case rebuilds the branch under it, and doing that per keystroke would take the caret out of the field being typed into.",
                    "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "lane-key"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "size": "sm",
                      "label": "Case value",
                      "placeholder": "value",
                      "value": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/label"
                      }
                    },
                    "onchange": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/rename"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "lane-actions-slot",
                  "role": "none"
                },
                "style": {
                  "display": "contents"
                },
                "$switch": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/removable"
                },
                "cases": {
                  "true": {
                    "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "lane-remove"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "size": "sm",
                      "quiet": true,
                      "icon": "trash",
                      "label": "${$map.item.title}"
                    },
                    "onclick": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/remove"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "add": {
            "$description": "The end of every lane. It opens the kit's menu rather than being a picker of its own: a select that has to snap back to its placeholder after each pick is a control fighting the runtime's skip-an-equal-write, and §12.5 asks for one list of actions rather than a second.",
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "add",
              "data-lane": "${$map.item.lane}"
            },
            "style": {
              "--stmt-indent": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/indent"
              }
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "add-statement"
                },
                "$props": {
                  "size": "sm",
                  "quiet": true,
                  "icon": "plus",
                  "haspopup": "menu",
                  "label": "${$map.item.title}"
                },
                "onclick": {
                  "$prototype": "Function",
                  "body": [
                    {
                      "operator": "call",
                      "target": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/add"
                      },
                      "value": [
                        {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                        },
                        {
                          "$ref": "event#/currentTarget"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tagName": "span",
                    "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "action": {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "action"
            },
            "style": {
              "--stmt-indent": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/indent"
              }
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "grow",
                  "data-action": "${$map.item.key}"
                },
                "$props": {
                  "size": "sm",
                  "quiet": true,
                  "icon": "plus",
                  "label": "${$map.item.label}"
                },
                "onclick": {
                  "$prototype": "Function",
                  "body": [
                    {
                      "operator": "call",
                      "target": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/act"
                      },
                      "value": [
                        {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tagName": "span",
                    "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
